# Service Commands

When the user asks to start or restart the service in this project, run the project daemon restart script:

```bash
bash bin/restart.sh && bash bin/status.sh
```

Interpret Chinese requests such as "启动服务", "重启服务", "重新启动服务", or "restart service" as this operation unless the user explicitly asks for a different command.

After restarting, report the service status, PID, port, and access URL if available.

# Commit Commands

When the user asks to run the project commit script, use:

```bash
bash bin/commit.sh "提交信息"
```

The script requires a commit message argument. If the user does not provide one, ask for the commit message before running it.
